Read `docs/agents/SECURITY.md` when touching auth, env, CI, or dependencies.

- Keep `GROQ_API_KEY` server-side only
- Run `pnpm security:audit` for dependency changes
- Do not add secret values to tracked files
- This is TypeScript — use ESLint/audit/gitleaks, not Python ruff
